  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f4e3c20903908693b25a0914b64bf7dfb5fa0b12edf15383d2668c999de4c244.png] \n\n**Given: **12 and 6 are interchanged and the signs ÷ and + are interchanged\n\nLet's check options one by one.\n\n option 1) 4 − 6 × 12 ÷ 5 + 7 = 22\n\n⇒ 4 − __**12 × 6**__ + __**5 ÷ 7**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __**4**__ - 72 + __**0.7**__ = 22\n\n​⇒ 4.7 - 72 = - 67.3 ≠ 22\n\n option 2) 6 ÷ 4 × 5 − 12 + 3 = 30\n\n⇒ __**6 + 3**__ − 8 − __**12 ÷ 1**__ = 15\n\n​⇒__** 9 - 8 - 12**__ = 15\n\n​⇒ 9 - 20 = 11 ≠ 15.\n\n** option 3) 6 ÷ 4 × 5 − 12 + 3 = 30**\n\n​⇒ 12 + __**4 × 5**__ − __**6 ÷ 3**__ = 30\n\n​⇒ __**12 + 20**__ - 2 = 30\n\n**​⇒ 32 - 2 = 30**\n\n option 4) 9 ÷ 6 × 4 + 12 − 3 = 18\n\n​⇒ 9 + 12 × __**4 ÷ 6**__ − 3 = 18\n\n​⇒ 9 + __**12 × .67**__ - 3 = 18\n\n​⇒ __**9 + 7.9**__ - 3 = 18\n\n⇒ **16.9 - 3 = 13.9** ≠ 18.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**\n\n64:T1622,\n<p&",
